=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/eb83ad71798947ed4b5f54524b2d993c.webp?t=1769796347\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/87169d5a36ce42e8675777911a17f76c.avif?t=1769796347\" width=780 height=250 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/6a05b8fd183b9616ea9bfabd18cc43ea.webp?t=1769796347\" width=780 height=50 /></span>Outgrow your garage and purchase new buildings. Need an office for your staff? I hope you have a down payment for the vacant office building downtown. Or are you running out of space for your inventory? How about this old factory hall with a foreman office?\u00a0 Automate, optimize, and experiment with different warehouse layouts to maximize efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/eb83ad71798947ed4b5f54524b2d993c.webp?t=1769796347\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/2b5b3d60a804d5dc5e43cefaadba0d66.poster.avif?t=1769796347\" width=760 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/2b5b3d60a804d5dc5e43cefaadba0d66.webm?t=1769796347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/2b5b3d60a804d5dc5e43cefaadba0d66.mp4?t=1769796347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/a949eda86e644d24eb3e3f92d9d29a10.avif?t=1769796347\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action has consequences in a world that simulates market trends and customer behavior. Influence your customers through marketing, your website, product or pricing strategy. Create Monopolies and exploit your market power or diversify to be resistant against market shocks. Each game will have a new combination of customer preference, making each playthrough unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/eb83ad71798947ed4b5f54524b2d993c.webp?t=1769796347\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/extras/9dc05cc2b3eadb646674e262ef0fe3b0.avif?t=1769796347\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never forget why you're doing this: Your cat needs a new food bowl! Keep her happy and maybe one day she will let you hold her. Feed your cat, pet her and with a bit of patience she will start to bond. Leave a few boxes out and you might find that she prefers those to a soft bed.</p>","developers":["Run Faster Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952400/9764b5c73093308031a3b95c6553a4a2172d9826/header.jpg?t=1769796347","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3952400/1828504955/3968dfc9ccbd0b1f267c5a2847c329548a7316d9/1760554605/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761427087","dash_h264":"https: